{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/a-miracle-after-the-tornado-1998-national-matches/","version_id":"562636b97fd6b47a8af68d4ebe7bd38aa4d26f972e3750653525fd9e781f1a6a","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this retrospective covers storm recovery and 1998 National Matches results without evidence about eligible gear for Mammoth conditions. Freshness and novelty supplies no reason to use this historical account for current gear decisions; the publisher is an NRA commercial publication, with no specific product sponsorship disclosed.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/new-woox-m-lok-leather-cartridge-quiver/","version_id":"ef814a8990c6bd25edecbb06748eee629cfe709de7878be1817d50ce876e7a9f","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, a rifle-mounted cartridge quiver falls outside the listed gear categories, and the announcement supplies no Mammoth-relevant field evidence. Commercial incentives and Credibility identify this NRA commercial publication's account as manufacturer-derived product information promoting WOOX's $69 carrier and compatible stock, rather than independent testing.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/benelli-invitational-raises-115-000-for-veterans/","version_id":"2d87f072c3f3a2ee431c4e4fb5d541dbacd67b70d7c1b04fe80007b8e81f6e0a","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this sporting-clays fundraiser report concerns donations and tournament results, with no eligible gear evidence connected to Mammoth. Under Commercial incentives, Benelli organizes the event and supplies fundraising claims and a promotional executive quotation in this NRA commercial publication.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/why-more-schools-are-adding-a-fall-clay-target-season/","version_id":"a0b1fcfcd6ea202ef47cee45d7750efb350fee2ac577749bbe8b1b5dfedec2a4","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, school clay-target participation, recruitment, and schedules do not inform Mammoth gear suitability or performance. Under Commercial incentives, this NRA commercial publication relays the League's own participation figures and recruitment messaging; no specific product sponsorship is disclosed.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/remington-s-shoot-to-cure-tops-70-000-for-arkansas-kids/","version_id":"8deee196fb354fa6d08b1b1400eadfe9670fee9699f92cdf0aaf3daab20f1ff2","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this charity sporting-clays report offers no evidence about in-scope Mammoth gear. Commercial incentives identifies Remington's event and ammunition sales promotion, plus Sharpe's Team Remington and Browning's Federal affiliations; Exclusions also bars ammunition coverage.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/oceanne-muller-goes-perfect-as-wvu-opens-bid-for-third-straight-title/","version_id":"003d4d7c74e6932f8c1ba8059b76eb0eb05624df1a01b4885f22bf6e88d38727","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this indoor collegiate air-rifle and smallbore match report provides scores and roster details without eligible gear evidence or a connection to Mammoth conditions. The source is an NRA commercial publication, but no specific product sponsorship is disclosed under Commercial incentives.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/fanizzi-runs-away-with-his-fifth-diamond-classic-title/","version_id":"b231e16c7a0b553bf50c642c12a46bd56df6083b6dd84be13eb7ec29517b9902","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance, Exclusions, and Making the decision, sporting-clays results and discussion of the Beretta A400 shotgun provide no in-scope Mammoth gear evidence. Commercial incentives and Credibility require recognizing the Team Beretta affiliations and Beretta executive's performance endorsement as commercially interested claims, not independent product validation.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/records-fall-legends-rise-1997-national-matches/","version_id":"57fdeecef998765371a7d5fa04766afce4f4cc0bcfefcea3dee2b47a4bef7491","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this history of 1997 National Matches scores, titles, and administration offers no eligible gear evaluation for Mammoth; its weather descriptions do not establish gear performance. Freshness and novelty reveals no new gear findings, and the NRA commercial publication discloses no specific product sponsorship.","piece_ids":[]}
{"item_id":"feed:https://www.ssusa.org/content/2026-27-ncaa-rifle-preview-can-anyone-stop-west-virginia/","version_id":"d73374e1b91f0e0ed2286b223586dcfe64f61607a9512a86fa39ddc3fd099283","decision":"reject","reason":"Under Relevance and Making the decision, this NCAA season preview covers teams, athletes, scores, and schedules rather than eligible gear or Mammoth field conditions. Under Commercial incentives, the source is an NRA commercial publication, with no specific product sponsorship disclosed in the preview.","piece_ids":[]}
